==================================================================================
PARITY (web ReauthDialog.tsx -> native), no scope narrowing
==================================================================================
  Data sources (web -> native P1/S8 seam):
    useReauthDialogState  -> ReauthChallengeContext presence + path (source-owned).
    useSessionMonitor     -> ReauthChallengeContext.mode ('open' ? confirm : credential).
    useTOTPStatus/useTOTP -> ReauthChallengeContext.totpTabAvailable.
    useTranslation        -> ReauthStrings facade (P1/S10), no literals.
    onSubmitCredential    -> ReauthCredentialService.submit (async; no HTTP in the view).
    onSubmit / onCancel   -> ReauthController.complete / cancel (sudo-queue resolution).
  Modes (web DialogMode):
    credential (forward-auth) -> tabs (Password always; Authenticator when offered) +
                                 secure password field | numeric one-time-code field +
                                 helper line; async exchange -> complete | mapped error.
    confirm (open-mode)       -> typed-confirmation field; CONFIRM-token guard; completes
                                 locally with an `open` credential (no network, no token).
  Logic (verbatim ports):
    TYPED_CONFIRMATION_TOKEN 'CONFIRM'   -> ReauthProjection.typedConfirmationToken.
    totp replace(/\D/g,'').slice(0,8)    -> sanitizeTOTP (ASCII digits, cap 8; unit-tested
                                            incl. Arabic-Indic digit rejection = web \d).
    confirmText.trim() === TOKEN         -> confirmMatches.
    password/totp empty guards           -> credentialFieldError.
    catch: REAUTH_NOT_CONFIGURED         -> submitErrorMessage notConfigured hint.
    catch: INVALID_CREDENTIAL            -> password->invalidPassword / totp->invalidTotp.
    catch: else err.message || unknown   -> submitErrorMessage default branch.
    reset-on-open/path + totp-tab fallback-> apply() resetFormIfChallengeChanged +
                                            fallbackTabIfNeeded (web useEffects).
    submitting guard on cancel           -> model.cancel() no-op while submitting.
  Composition (web Modal/form -> native):
    Modal title (mode-aware) + close "×" -> ReauthHeader (title + freshness chip + close).
    <p> body (mode-aware, {{token}})     -> body line (Text verbatim, token substituted).
    Tabs (Password/Authenticator)        -> ReauthMethodTabs (verbatim-titled, a11y
                                            tablist "Reauth method"; built in-surface
                                            because shared TSTabs' LocalizedStringKey API
                                            can't resolve the per-surface i18n table).
    Input type=password autocomplete     -> ReauthSecureField (.textContentType(.password)).
    Input numeric one-time-code          -> ReauthNumericField (.oneTimeCode, numberPad on
                                            iOS; sanitised binding via model.updateTOTP).
    Input typed-confirmation             -> ReauthTextField (no autocap/autocorrect).
    HelperText                           -> helper line.
    ErrorText                            -> ReauthErrorText.
    Button ghost Cancel (disabled subm.) -> TSButton(.ghost).disabled(submitting).
    Button primary submit (loading)      -> TSButton(.primary, isLoading: submitting);
                                            title Continue (confirm) / Confirm (credential).
  Dismissal = a queue consequence (web parity): complete/cancel drive the controller which
  resolves/rejects the active sudo challenge; the presenting host observes that and
  dismisses around the surface (no separate onClose; the close "×" routes to cancel).
  Tailwind classes were NOT ported; chrome is P1/S9 tokens (TSSpacing/TSRadius/Color.TS/
  Font.TS) via TSGlassPanel/TSFadeIn/TSButton.

==================================================================================
STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
==================================================================================
  loading  -> ReauthLoadingState (spinner + "Verifying your session…").
  empty    -> ReauthEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView "No action is awaiting
              confirmation") — the native widening of the web "modal hidden when nothing
              pending".
  error    -> ReauthErrorState (QueryError-equivalent + Retry -> model.refresh()).
  stale    -> freshness chip "Stale" + connectivity banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh.
  offline  -> freshness chip "Offline" + banner; cached context kept; no refetch.
  content  -> the populated form (+ inline reload error if a mode refresh failed while a
              cached context remains).
  Telemetry: model.start() emits P1/S11 view.opened surface="ReauthDialog" (once,
  idempotent — ModelTests proven).

